-- statement:
--   For the exact original Levy jump measure of X and its original right-continuous filtration, every bounded-clock discounted compact-band Taylor jump minus its physical predictable random compensator is integrable and has expectation zero. Source-specific Taylor L1 is automatic; the exact predictable measurability and original physical jump/time intensity records are explicit, independently checkable hypotheses. The stopping clock appears identically in both integrals.

